<title>NEW ZEALAND: SNZ releases latest NZ population estimate.</title>
<headline>SNZ releases latest NZ population estimate.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's total population is provisionally estimated to have been 3.614 million at September 30, 1996, Statistics New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>The figure will be revised when final population counts become available early next year.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
